    "title": "Traffic shift coming to the beltway - NewsBreak",
    "text": "Washington\nTraffic shift coming to the beltway\n1 hours ago\nWASHINGTON — Attention drivers, turn your blinker lights on and prepare for a shift in traffic flow along the beltway. Beginning Friday, crews will implement phase one of a two-phase project to shift all four lanes along southbound I-495 within the I-495 Express Lanes as part of the 495 NEXT project.",
